<div style="min-height: 100vh; padding: 3rem 1.5rem 4rem;">
  <div style="max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;">

    <%# Header %>
    <div style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      <h1 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 4rem); letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: #3b0764; margin: 0 0 0.5rem;">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p style="font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #6d28d9; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: normal; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; opacity: 0.8;">
        Simple rules for a safe space.
      </p>
      <p style="font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #a78bfa; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: normal; margin: 0; font-style: italic;">
        Last Updated: January 29, 2026
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem;">

      <%# Important warning %>
      <div style="background: #fef2f2; border: 1.5px solid rgba(220,38,38,0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;">
        <p style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: #dc2626; margin: 0 0 0.5rem;">
          ⚠️ Important: Not Medical Advice
        </p>
        <p style="font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #991b1b; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;">
          Memflect is a tool for self-reflection and personal growth. It is <strong>not</strong> a substitute for professional therapy, medical advice, or crisis intervention. If you are in crisis or need mental health support, please contact a professional immediately.
        </p>
      </div>

      <%# Content card %>
      <div style="background: white; border-radius: 24px; border: 1px solid rgba(109,40,217,0.1); padding: 2.5rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 32px rgba(109,40,217,0.08); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2rem;">

        <% [
          ["The Agreement", "By using Memflect, you agree to treat this tool — and yourself — with respect. You own your data, but we own the platform. We grant you a personal, non-exclusive license to use the app for its intended purpose."],
          ["Acceptable Use", "You are responsible for your account. Do not use Memflect for illegal activities, hate speech, or to harm others. We reserve the right to suspend accounts that violate these core values."],
          ["Payments & Refunds", "Memflect charges a one-time fee of $3.99 per extended reflection. All sales are final once the audio file has been generated and delivered. However, if you experience a technical issue that prevents you from receiving your reflection, contact us at <a href=\"mailto:ryan@memflect.com\" style=\"color: #7c3aed;\">ryan@memflect.com</a> and we'll make it right."],
          ["Content Ownership", "You own your memory text, voice recordings, and the reflections generated from them. Memflect uses AI (ElevenLabs voice cloning, OpenAI text generation) to create your reflections, but the output belongs to you. We do not use your content for any purpose other than generating your personal reflection."],
          ["\"As Is\" Service", "We build software with love, but bugs happen. Memflect is provided \"as is.\" To the maximum extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any damages (data loss, service interruption, etc.) arising from your use of the app. Our total liability is limited to the amount you paid for the service."],
          ["Dispute Resolution", "If you have a dispute with Memflect, please email <a href=\"mailto:ryan@memflect.com\" style=\"color: #7c3aed;\">ryan@memflect.com</a> first. We'll work in good faith to resolve it. If we can't, disputes are governed by the laws of Singapore."],
          ["Contact", "Questions? Concerns? Email the founder directly: <a href=\"mailto:ryan@memflect.com\" style=\"color: #7c3aed;\">ryan@memflect.com</a>"]
        ].each do |heading, body| %>
          <div>
            <h2 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 1.4rem; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: #3b0764; margin: 0 0 0.75rem;">
              <%= heading %>
            </h2>
            <p style="font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #4c1d95; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0; opacity: 0.85;">
              <%= body.html_safe %>
            </p>
          </div>
        <% end %>

      </div>

    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 2rem;">
      <%= link_to "← Back to Home", root_path,
            style: "font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #7c3aed; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: normal; text-decoration: none;" %>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>